---
// @TASK 디자인 리뉴얼 - Hero
---

<section id="hero" class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center hero-gradient pt-20 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- Background Pattern -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 tech-pattern opacity-30"></div>

  <!-- Blur Effects -->
  <div class="absolute top-1/4 -right-20 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-500/10 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-1/4 -left-20 w-96 h-96 bg-indigo-500/10 rounded-full blur-[120px]"></div>

  <!-- Content -->
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
    <!-- Badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full mb-8 backdrop-blur-sm">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-blue-400 text-sm">rocket_launch</span>
      <span class="text-sm font-medium text-white/90">2025년 설립 · AI 에이전트 스타트업</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 tracking-tight">
      InsightFlo
    </h1>
    <h2 class="text-xl md:text-3xl font-medium text-blue-100/90 mb-6 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      업무를 워크플로우로 옮기면,<br/>
      <span class="text-blue-400">AI 에이전트가 실행하고 관리합니다</span>
    </h2>
    <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-white/60 mb-12 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      비주얼 워크플로우 자동화 플랫폼을 직접 만들어 운영합니다. 매일 발행되는 AI 매체 '온보딩'과 GEO/SEO 진단 에이전트에 같은 방식을 씁니다.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-5">
      <a href="#products" class="px-10 py-5 bg-white text-navy rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:shadow-2xl hover:scale-105 transition-all">
        제품 보기
      </a>
      <a href="#contact" class="px-10 py-5 bg-transparent border border-white/30 text-white rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-all">
        무료 상담 신청
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Stats -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 sm:gap-8 mt-16 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">581편+</div>
        <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/60 mt-1">자체 매체 누적 발행</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">매일</div>
        <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/60 mt-1">자동 발행 운영 중</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white">10년+</div>
        <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/60 mt-1">도메인 실무 경험</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Product Screenshot -->
    <div class="mt-16 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-800/60 backdrop-blur p-2 shadow-2xl">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2">
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-400/80"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-400/80"></span>
          <span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-400/80"></span>
          <div class="flex-1 bg-slate-900/70 rounded-md px-3 py-1 text-xs text-white/50 text-left font-mono">mock.co.kr</div>
        </div>
        <img src="/images/onboarding-screenshot.png" alt="AI 네이티브 뉴스 브리핑 온보딩(mock.co.kr) 화면" class="rounded-xl w-full" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-white/40 text-xs mt-4">자체 운영 중인 AI 매체 '온보딩' — 리서치부터 발행·배포까지 전 과정 자동화, 지표는 그대로 공개</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-gradient {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0F172A 0%, #1E3A5F 100%);
  }
  .tech-pattern {
    background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 2px 2px, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 1px, transparent 0);
    background-size: 32px 32px;
  }
  .text-navy { color: #0F172A; }
</style>
